Subject: [PATCH] Allow using the tool multiple times
Improve time change input
Fix battery charge and discharge
---
Index: MainWindow.xaml.cs
IDEA additional info:
Subsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP
<+>UTF-8
===================================================================
diff --git a/MainWindow.xaml.cs b/MainWindow.xaml.cs
--- a/MainWindow.xaml.cs	(revision e9c309f7ee685bd6052d2552b7e699bb91fb2b47)
+++ b/MainWindow.xaml.cs	(revision f70b148001476c67b14d43119209a58c9dfcbc33)
